OL,3,ATwenty-five dead after fire on cargo
OL,4,Aship in eastern China
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-five people have been killed in
OL,7,Fa fire on a foreign-flagged cargo ship
OL,8,Fdocked at a port in eastern China,
OL,9,Faccording to Chinese state broadcaster
OL,10,FCCTV.
OL,12,FOf the 42 people on board, 17 were were
OL,13,Fevacuated of which five are in hospital
OL,14,Fin stable condition, CCTV reports.
OL,16,FThe vessel was undergoing maintenance
OL,17,Fat a shipyard in the city of Qingdao
OL,18,Fwhen the blaze erupted at around 11:15
OL,19,Flocal time (03:15 GMT). It was put out
OL,20,Fjust over three hours later, according
OL,21,Fto CCTV.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
