OL,3,ATwenty-five dead after fire on cargo
OL,4,Aship in eastern China
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotos released by state media showed
OL,7,Fthe vessel to be the Ocean Melody, a
OL,8,F190m (623ft) long Liberia-flagged
OL,9,Fcarrier which arrived in Qingdao on 31
OL,10,FAugust, according to tracking site
OL,11,FMarineTraffic.
